  "comment": [
    "Runtime reflection/resources of the /doc/pdf CDP path that the static AOT analysis (AotPlugin)",
    "cannot derive: the PDF service talks CDP over a WebSocket, and the Tyrus client container plus",
    "its Grizzly transport are discovered and instantiated by ServiceLoader/Class.forName at run time,",
    "so without these entries the native image fails with",
    "\"jakarta.websocket.DeploymentException: org.glassfish.tyrus.container.grizzly.client.GrizzlyClientContainer\".",
    "Collected with the GraalVM 25 native-image tracing agent (25.3.4.1) while printing a page to PDF."
